	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Egi tibi gratias pro tua temporum digestione<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a">Zu dieser Schrift s. auch <persName ref="p7844">Wolrads</persName> Tagebuch vom <placeName ref="l18">Augsburger</placeName> RT 1548, ed. Tross, S. 37f.</note> adiunxique illis literis meis, quę tum <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>videbantur necessaria; misi autem meas per quendam literatum, qui se <persName ref="p20817">Clementem</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>appellabat<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Ev. <persName ref="p20817">Clemens Lenner</persName>? Vgl. <bibl source="b645">Vadian BW</bibl> VI, Reg., und unten Nr. 18125. - Laut e-Mail von Rainer Henrich vom 15.04.2014 handelt es sich eher um den St. Galler "Lesmaister" und Musiker Clemens Hör.</note>; spero eas tibi esse redditas.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Nunc scias nobis per <lb xml:id="p1z4"/><persName ref="p18538">Cesaream maiestatem</persName> esse formulam religionis, quę vocatur Interim, pręscriptam <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>et publicatam, iuxta quam et credi et agi vult <persName ref="p18538">Cęsar</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Principio <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>de peccato et iustificatione non admodum male disponitur, nisi quod opera <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>nimium licenter adiungantur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Sacramentorum numerus est 7, de quibus omnibus <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>perperam docetur, presertim de cena domini et missa, in qua transsubstantiationem <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>panis et vini, venerationem et intercessionem demortuorum sanctorum et oblationem <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>corporis et sanguinis Christi per sacerdotem aperte inducunt.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Item coniugium <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>sacerdotale et communionem sub utraque spetie, quantum ad laycos pertinet, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>tantum usque ad definitionem vel determinationem <placeName ref="l1107">Tridentini</placeName> concilii tolerant.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Pręterea nemo concionari debet nisi ordinatus et approbatus ab episcopis <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>ordinatiis.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Summa: preter papatum nihil aliud est et in hoc peior, quod <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>papistę laudantur propter constantiam et perseverationem in pristina eorum <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>religione, admonentur quoque, ut ita perdurent, reliqui vero, ut ad ecclesiam <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>eorum revertamtur, multum incitantur.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">In quo papatus per comnia confirmatur, <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>cęteri vero omnes dmnantur.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Hoc iugum super et pręterterrena <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>omnia conculcata ferimus, atque hęc est sors nostra, quoniam sine cruce christianus <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>non emergit.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Ora diligenter pro nobis, atque si contigerit me in his erumnis <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>oppetere, te visurus sum in aeterna patria.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salveant tui omnes, <persName ref="p8018">Hallerus</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/><persName ref="p8011">Gvaltherus</persName>.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Afflictio vestra haud ita longe abest.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Dux <persName ref="p18250">Mauritius Saxo</persName>, <persName ref="p20434">Ioannes marchio Brandenburgensis</persName>, <persName ref="p18935">dux Zwey<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>prucken</persName> et Civitates nolunt in hoc Interim consentire.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Quod si violentia <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>accesserit, certe <persName>Neroniana</persName> vel <persName>Maximiana</persName> clades sequetur.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="de">20. maii<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>.</s>
				</p>
